To increase the distance the drone keeps from obstacles, you need to tune the parameters in the FUEL Exploration Planner configuration file.

The primary configuration file for this is: /home/ayush/Desktop/NIDAR/config/fuel/exploration_planner.yaml

Here are the specific parameters you need to adjust:

1. Obstacle Map Inflation (obstacles_inflation)
Current Value: 0.20 (20 cm)
What it does: This is the most direct way to keep the drone away from walls. It artificially "bloats" every obstacle in the 3D voxel map by this distance. If you set it to 0.40, the planner will act as if every wall and box is 40cm thicker than it actually is.
Recommendation: Increase this to 0.40 or 0.50 to ensure the drone maintains a wider berth around all objects.
2. Kinodynamic Minimum Clearance (d_min)
Current Value: 0.25 (25 cm)
What it does: This parameter dictates the strict minimum clearance distance used by the B-spline trajectory optimizer. When the planner generates a smooth flight path, it mathematically penalizes any path that comes closer than d_min to an inflated obstacle.
Recommendation: Increase this to 0.40 or 0.50 to force the optimizer to push trajectories further toward the center of open spaces.
3. Local Bound Inflate (local_bound_inflate)
Current Value: 0.5
What it does: This adds a safety buffer margin around the local sliding window map. It prevents the planner from generating paths that skim exactly along the edge of known vs. unknown space where unseen obstacles might lurk.
Recommendation: You can leave this at 0.5, or bump it to 0.8 if you notice the drone clipping corners when turning into newly explored aisles.
Summary of Changes to Apply
Open /home/ayush/Desktop/NIDAR/config/fuel/exploration_planner.yaml and modify these lines:

yaml
sdf_map:
  ...
  obstacles_inflation: 0.50   # <-- Increase from 0.20 to 0.50
exploration_planner:
  ...
  d_min: 0.50                 # <-- Increase from 0.25 to 0.50
By changing these two parameters to 0.50, the drone will attempt to maintain a minimum clearance of half a meter from all obstacles while exploring the warehouse.
